sequenceDiagram
  participant F as Frontend
  participant B as Backend
  participant S as Session store
  F->>B: POST /auth/login
  B->>S: create session
  B-->>F: access token + HttpOnly refresh cookie
  F->>B: request with bearer token
  F->>B: POST /auth/refresh with cookie
  B->>S: rotate session
  B-->>F: new access token + rotated cookie
  F->>B: POST /auth/logout
  B->>S: revoke session
  B-->>F: clear cookie
